    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The walls had ears.\u00a0 Now they have feelings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wall is a short first person exploration game about connection, routine, and the fragile weight of being seen.\u00a0 Take up space with Wall, and discover what lies beneath (and beyond) the brick and mortar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730460/extras/528d2f2f11f8a7410fa5eb88ddbc2019.poster.avif?t=1749431383\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730460/extras/528d2f2f11f8a7410fa5eb88ddbc2019.webm?t=1749431383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730460/extras/528d2f2f11f8a7410fa5eb88ddbc2019.mp4?t=1749431383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At it's core, this is a game about talking to a Wall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unless it\u2019s about something else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hard to say, really.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730460/extras/f340b6f5a14b7598394fc93edfd72566.poster.avif?t=1749431383\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730460/extras/f340b6f5a14b7598394fc93edfd72566.webm?t=1749431383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730460/extras/f340b6f5a14b7598394fc93edfd72566.mp4?t=1749431383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A cube-shaped companion with surprisingly deep thoughts</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Conversations that unfold as you pace</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Other rooms (allegedly)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- At least one emotionally suspicious mannequin</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730460/extras/4d8541035080b39fc90209ed9f9c2c64.poster.avif?t=1749431383\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730460/extras/4d8541035080b39fc90209ed9f9c2c64.webm?t=1749431383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730460/extras/4d8541035080b39fc90209ed9f9c2c64.mp4?t=1749431383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The walls had ears.\u00a0 Now they have feelings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wall is a short first person exploration game about connection, routine, and the fragile weight of being seen.\u00a0 Take up space with Wall, and discover what lies beneath (and beyond) the brick and mortar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730460/extras/528d2f2f11f8a7410fa5eb88ddbc2019.poster.avif?t=1749431383\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730460/extras/528d2f2f11f8a7410fa5eb88ddbc2019.webm?t=1749431383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730460/extras/528d2f2f11f8a7410fa5eb88ddbc2019.mp4?t=1749431383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At it's core, this is a game about talking to a Wall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unless it\u2019s about something else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hard to say, really.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730460/extras/f340b6f5a14b7598394fc93edfd72566.poster.avif?t=1749431383\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730460/extras/f340b6f5a14b7598394fc93edfd72566.webm?t=1749431383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730460/extras/f340b6f5a14b7598394fc93edfd72566.mp4?t=1749431383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A cube-shaped companion with surprisingly deep thoughts</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Conversations that unfold as you pace</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Other rooms (allegedly)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- At least one emotionally suspicious mannequin</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730460/extras/4d8541035080b39fc90209ed9f9c2c64.poster.avif?t=1749431383\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730460/extras/4d8541035080b39fc90209ed9f9c2c64.webm?t=1749431383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730460/extras/4d8541035080b39fc90209ed9f9c2c64.mp4?t=1749431383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "A short narrative adventure about friendship, loneliness, and staring at surfaces for meaning. Join your personal upright companion through an exploration into what it means to be Human, and what it means to be Wall.",
